# A small token for trying the erc20 application by hand.
#
# Six accounts; account a is owned by party a mod n. Each party's
# testdata/inputs/erc20_input_<id>.txt holds its accounts' balances, then the
# amounts of the transfers its accounts send, one signed decimal per line.
# Seven transfers in four epochs: 1 received in epoch 1, so its payment
# opens epoch 2; 4 received in epoch 2, so its payment opens epoch 3; 5
# received in epoch 3, so its payment opens epoch 4, which 0 → 2 joins.
accounts 6
0 1
2 3
1 4
3 0
4 5
5 2
0 2
